flowchart LR
    Patient[Patient]
    Doctor[Doctor]
    Receptionist[Receptionist]
    Admin[Administrator]
    HMS((Hospital Management System))

    Patient -->|Registration, login, profile data, booking and cancellation requests| HMS
    HMS -->|Available doctors, appointment status, prescriptions, medical history and invoices| Patient

    Doctor -->|Availability, consultation notes, diagnosis and prescriptions| HMS
    HMS -->|Assigned appointments and authorized patient history| Doctor

    Receptionist -->|Patient registration, walk-in data, appointment and billing updates| HMS
    HMS -->|Schedules, patient details, appointment status and invoice information| Receptionist

    Admin -->|Staff management, configuration and oversight requests| HMS
    HMS -->|Operational summaries, account status and audit information| Admin

